            "review_text": "Andy\n2 contributions\n0\nbad. bad\nNov 2023 • Friends\nI've been here many times, the food is delicious, the space is beautiful, and the staff is enthusiastic about giving advice. But the last experience was so bad, the dishes had to wait for a long time, I ordered 2 nigiri but it took 30 minutes and still no food. When I canceled the order and complained, only the waiter came out to apologize, and the restaurant manager was nowhere to be seen. When I canceled my order and went home, I saw the manager standing and chatting happily with another table, and didn't even bother to greet me or apologize for the delay. It was truly a terrible experience\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 9, 2023",
